+---
+id: task-001-implement-json-pointer-rfc-6901-resolvepointer
+type: task
+title: "Implement JSON Pointer (RFC 6901) resolvePointer"
+status: approved
+format: 1
+---
+
+Implement JSON Pointer per RFC 6901.
+
+- Export `resolvePointer(document, pointer)` from `src/index.ts`.
+- Returns the referenced value; throws if the pointer is not syntactically valid (must be empty or start
+  with `/`; `~` only followed by `0` or `1`) or does not resolve to a value in the document.
+- Array indices: `0` or digits without leading zeros; `-` (nonexistent element) and out-of-range throw.
+- Only own properties are resolved (no prototype access).
diff --git a/src/index.test.ts b/src/index.test.ts
new file mode 100644
